I remember he had curly hair, it was gelled. He had some silver chains on. And I just started opening my mouth to say sorry. And he looks at me just daggers, right? In his eyes and his shoulders are set and he is coming towards me fast and he says, you're dead. Get out of the car. I'm gonna kill you. Kurt was terrified. He stepped on the gas and took off. To his horror, the driver of the Mercedes hurried back to his car, jumped in it, and came off to him.

