and he's getting closer and closer on my tail. And eventually I turn into a parking lot of like a Home Depot store. And he, you know, revs and gets close to me and I turn and I go behind this store into the loading dock. And so there's a steep embankment on my right. So I'm really like funneled into this little canyon with this guy behind me.

