And all my friends, we were talking on the way there, obviously we were having fun, deadly silent, no music. My one friend in the back who's thinking lucidly, her name is Jessie, she says, lock the door. And so I immediately locked the door, and a second later he grabs my handle and just starts to haul on the handle trying to pull me out of the car.

17
