Wow, but the door is locked at this point, so he can't get in. Exactly, but I also realize I have to diffuse the situation because he's so angry and much bigger than me. And so I do the only thing I can, because he's so angry and much bigger than me. And so I do the only thing I can, which is, you know, start to apologize. So I unroll my window a few inches.

