00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:44.000
to kill me. And then eventually he stops, it sinks in, and he takes his hand away and he kind of bends down and he looks through the crack in the window he takes his hand away, and he kind of bends down, and he looks through the crack in the window at all of us in the car, and he says, fine, you call the cops, and I'll tell them what you did. And this statement was perplexing to me, because clearly in my mind,

