a simple mistake, and I'm really sorry about it, but surely that mistake doesn't warrant somebody chasing me through dark streets for mile upon mile, cornering me and threatening to kill me. I agree. And as I started to do research on moral psychology, I came more and more to recognize the genuine concerns that he had about being harmed.

