We generally think that we, our side, is smart, that we vote in our own self-interest and that we do things that make sense. And we think that we want policies that are gonna help ourselves and the country. But when we think of our opponents, we think of them as being quite stupid. We think of them as not voting in their own self-interest and we think of them not wanting policies

30
