00:15:46.000 --> 00:16:09.000
are not those things at all. They are tricked by the media, they are deceived by some leader, that they are sheeple, and we just think that they're stupid. So we think our opponents are not very smart, but it's also the case that we feel like we don't like our opponents very much, but we think our opponents have stronger feelings about us.

